# === Server ===
PORT=3000

# === Auth Mode: Token Passthrough ===
# This MCP server holds ZERO credentials.
# The client (Copilot Studio) authenticates the user via OAuth 2.0
# and sends the user's Bearer token on every request.
# The server forwards that token directly to Microsoft Graph Security API.
#
# Benefits:
#   - No secrets to manage, rotate, or leak
#   - RBAC per user — each analyst only sees their permitted data
#   - The server is stateless and tenant-agnostic
#
# Required Delegated Permissions (on the Copilot Studio App Registration):
#   Microsoft Graph:
#     - SecurityIncident.Read.All
#     - SecurityAlert.Read.All
#     - ThreatHunting.Read.All
